imminent arrival at their house of an assortment of wizards was making the
Dursleys uptight and irritable. Uncle Vernon had looked downright alarmed
when Harry informed him that the Weasleys would be arriving at five o’clock
the very next day.
“I hope you told them to dress properly, these people,” he snarled at once.
