looked like a gesture of welcome, but Harry knew it was because Uncle
Vernon wanted to look impressive and intimidating. Dudley, on the other
hand, looked somehow diminished. This was not because the diet was at last
taking effect, but due to fright. Dudley had emerged from his last encounter
