pudding. Harry looked round at his godfather.
“Molly doesn’t approve of Mundungus,” said Sirius in an undertone.
“How come he’s in the Order?” Harry said very quietly.
“He’s useful,” Sirius muttered. “Knows all the crooks — well, he would,
seeing as he’s one himself. But he’s also very loyal to Dumbledore, who
helped him out of a tight spot once. It pays to have someone like Dung
around, he hears things we don’t. But Molly thinks inviting him to stay for
